            <div xml:id="m-375adaee-58d4-42ee-a806-c83ba3aa4297">
              <lg xml:id="m-2a0f599b-c4af-4aaa-8d56-074033e99c49">
                <l xml:id="m-a4b34adb-0e52-436a-9108-8a94aee2f792" facs="#m-9b98e7b0-f633-45e7-af96-dc90ff272275" label="ambiguous">270n</l><l xml:id="m-279e2d88-2f52-4177-9444-7e83b416ab66" facs="#m-cee384f7-e440-489e-8f56-ef0adbc6285c" label="text-like">for Feasts which are not I. class.</l><l xml:id="m-8833d8e7-0309-4f9d-afe7-2c643c47b0e7" facs="#m-29089444-60e6-4d6e-b131-96c79cc0f38a" label="ambiguous">Psalm 43. III.</l><l xml:id="m-086fa252-fa45-49b9-af2f-2d0018f9ee8b" facs="#m-d773770f-1593-413a-b3c8-78fb7fe49e14" label="lyrics-like">I obliti súmus nómen Déi nóstri, *et si expándimus mánus nóstras</l><l xml:id="m-e4450ef6-0260-4b6c-be71-bb86b6ead59a" facs="#m-3bd69869-1310-42db-9b7b-5c1bdac4ea84" label="lyrics-like">D ad déum atiénum:</l><l xml:id="m-001add63-e4c6-472f-996f-556531bc99e3" facs="#m-3ad06f36-0093-40a3-a15e-39a70a9239e3" label="lyrics-like">2. Nónne Déus requíret ista? * ipse enim nóvit abscóndita córdis.</l><l xml:id="m-ee466d61-03a4-41e9-9572-4b7df5528056" facs="#m-9e9c334e-d252-4a74-b4c4-5f074ca5b973" label="lyrics-like">3. Quóniam propter te mortificámur tóta die:“aestimáti súmus sicut</l><l xml:id="m-074e9c19-4336-42b6-9dd9-711d7401afec" facs="#m-cb1131c7-3f4f-4743-b52b-aef6e1fdf8b3" label="lyrics-like">óves õccistónis.</l><l xml:id="m-762f2289-ae6b-4bc8-b703-3a5d28a11b46" facs="#m-1aa503be-a54c-4403-9524-ea977c0fb5df" label="lyrics-like">4. Exsúrge, quare obdórmis, Dómine? “exsúrge. et ne repéllas in</l><l xml:id="m-2db9229c-7c05-4867-965b-d8081ecc368a" facs="#m-875a18ac-ab2a-4bb0-90dc-f61db62c2075" label="ambiguous">finem.</l><l xml:id="m-d94c6bb9-9e59-459b-8223-8c68438cf77a" facs="#m-910fa6c7-06b1-4446-8854-06370ad3861f" label="lyrics-like">5. Quare fáciem túam avértis, * oblivísceris inópiae nóstrae et tribu¬</l><l xml:id="m-90555f5c-b5cf-4a1f-a8a4-307eab6026db" facs="#m-d8a731bd-8230-4eec-832a-7cb9b08d78d8" label="lyrics-like">latiónis nóstrae?</l><l xml:id="m-553b8237-f164-4c99-8430-8381fad465e1" facs="#m-0f471db1-c476-474d-bb64-21650cfbd44d" label="lyrics-like">6. Quóniam humiliáta est in púlvere ánima nóstra:*conglutinátus</l><l xml:id="m-b2d6fe80-51cd-46ab-9582-e946103bd4aa" facs="#m-8e437962-d2ec-4be3-97ae-c439c2635ec8" label="lyrics-like">est in térra venter nóster.</l><l xml:id="m-437111b4-915b-470a-8f6e-3993e48dafa8" facs="#m-69cce259-e3d8-4cac-b666-dd6970525cdc" label="lyrics-like">7. Exsúrge, Dómine, ádjuva nos: “ et rédime nos propter nómen</l><l xml:id="m-7dba4b0d-37ea-4456-b157-6be0521b2bc7" facs="#m-b75cf2f9-451e-4e3f-8108-aa8ef285e0b6" label="lyrics-like">túum.</l><l xml:id="m-ff6bf4b8-3d17-45ce-a855-505bafb2259f" facs="#m-0748fa7b-4cc4-4890-ada1-1ff591f6a324" label="ambiguous">An¬</l><l xml:id="m-71c8b0a7-17de-4e5a-8baa-9b721c239677" facs="#m-7d71f4ef-ee7c-4b54-9737-aa757842b5ee" label="ambiguous">tiphon.</l><l xml:id="m-aa362acf-323e-4d3e-8c3f-bea7500b7ac1" facs="#m-048d63a7-67e7-4fe5-82f6-7e0e628d797d" label="lyrics-like">Salvásti nos, Dómine,</l><l xml:id="m-45058462-c99c-484d-a03c-fd59aace7d54" facs="#m-ee40ba8f-f2d9-4256-bed3-21b5ae1f3d36" label="lyrics-like">et in nómine tú-o con¬</l><l xml:id="m-6b5922b8-8103-433b-bb1d-0160c665ed3a" facs="#m-93c3a8e3-60f8-4cf9-a907-df0d9b821865" label="lyrics-like">fi-tébimur in saécu-la.</l><l xml:id="m-d8a45eb6-2434-40e5-bbe8-250be5d08ccd" facs="#m-8aadf458-bad9-4684-be39-79c40ac42e8e" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Allelúia, allelúia, allelúia. p. 249.</l><l xml:id="m-4a619ce0-ff4d-41f6-8786-5b4945d88bab" facs="#m-14aebdd0-0952-4132-8331-946663415f21" label="text-like">WEDNESDAY AT PRIME.</l><l xml:id="m-8da9fe95-4728-49b2-86c3-39d7dba0af89" facs="#m-faf652b1-6225-456b-8e42-1ed6433f962f" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-aa8eb747-256a-4862-8ead-307c63f42e63" facs="#m-7abaeaf5-d29b-475c-be4a-5202e0b9ad58" label="ambiguous">1.g</l><l xml:id="m-634f012f-13a1-403e-8c0c-aff1885cf1db" facs="#m-c51130f1-5b28-4af3-8027-1e0ac774ab75" label="lyrics-like">L-se-ri-córdi-a tú-a. Eu oua e</l><l xml:id="m-287ccdea-206b-4827-a2b2-81a6ccc542b3" facs="#m-d0a9a7ca-7fdc-4bec-b3ce-5d6c6f02ef1e" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Allelúia. p. 225.</l><l xml:id="m-88edd7ff-23a3-4ce0-92c0-442f9f82ff37" facs="#m-544e7489-6605-409e-afad-0435bc3e927b" label="ambiguous">Psalm 25.</l><l xml:id="m-8948f951-9356-4df9-a9b1-6628c6adc2bd" facs="#m-3c28c02e-4e5f-48b5-a125-3a6d278e1d90" label="lyrics-like">Udica me, Dómine, quóniam égo in innocéntia méa ingréssus</l><l xml:id="m-a103b9d9-dcef-4fc1-a8c5-da05a0a0a865" facs="#m-01da7572-e939-4b36-9fb8-b83491f9f811" label="lyrics-like">sum:*et in Dómino spérans non infirmábor.</l><l xml:id="m-2949d40a-79e6-4cf7-8807-eade5488a866" facs="#m-91c6bb8f-abf7-44f2-8eb2-368aba9b944c" label="lyrics-like">2. Próba me, Dómine, et ténta me: * úre rénes méos et cor</l><l xml:id="m-99790ec0-b171-4307-bd3a-7449444adb17" facs="#m-b88e4cf8-f560-4dbc-bfba-7e4cc56b0273" label="lyrics-like">méum.</l><l xml:id="m-c6816761-e070-49da-9902-5030e89dcbbd" facs="#m-4c823c3f-3890-41bb-b839-94c2b28310d3" label="lyrics-like">3. Quóniam misericórdia túa ante óculos méos est:* et complácui</l><l xml:id="m-308066f3-c2a8-4b4e-b805-8178e1bcd798" facs="#m-ffe1ca91-35b0-4fcb-94ae-7a9119d764de" label="lyrics-like">in veritáte túa.</l><l xml:id="m-988d9110-870e-49c0-8405-32135c689a8f" facs="#m-c015c06b-fa64-40db-8322-4598365e4fbc" label="lyrics-like">4. Non sédi cum concilio vanitátis: “ et cum iníqua geréntibus non</l><l xml:id="m-21645437-5797-43c8-866b-0076cfe03d4e" facs="#m-990f0bfd-c60c-4d8b-87bb-afdd7336b927" label="ambiguous">introibo.</l><l xml:id="m-61b50fd9-6ef1-442a-b370-d0fce139988b" facs="#m-9082411e-6710-4d48-b1a6-999d25bba510" label="lyrics-like">5. Odívi ecclésiam malignántium: “ et cum impiis non sedébo.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>